{"id":"vod_sn_37618","vodId":"37618","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"稻荷恋之歌","name_cn":"稻荷恋之歌","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/256d4b7eba740fcfefd6560af50a0806.jpg"},"summary":"沉淀了历史浓厚气息的京都伏见，生活着一个有些鲁莽但十分单纯的女孩伏见稻荷（大空直美 配音）。她从小在供奉着狐仙的稻禾神社玩耍，对这里有着深深的羁绊。稻荷偷偷喜欢同班的帅气男孩丹波桥红司（冈本宽志 配音），无奈对方似乎只对美丽的墨染朱美（野水伊织 配音）感兴趣。因意外惹恼丹波桥的稻荷闷闷不乐，此前她偶然救助过一只小狐狸，因此得以觐见神社的狐仙宇迦之御魂神（桑岛法子 配音）。　　在神的帮助下，稻荷拥有了变身的能力，可以自由变化成任何实际存在的人。加上小狐狸空从旁相助，女孩的青春发生了变化……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:00","playable":true,"episodeCount":10,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7Es6XWbDts1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/a5dczA72nJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/L3xKMyWc2t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/iTiYcNJwFt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hUNL6AJHVK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/11XGPD5Y2y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fmpBB27JXS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r3wub1rybk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/EJYAC0hXtr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/guzXe212001/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:08.709Z"}